data: {"id": "8a5d9813708a4919-thinking-parallel_evidence-741", "run_id": "8a5d9813708a4919", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "基于对 `aiops-case-v07/workload` 的多维度实时工具结果，当前异常状态与根因证据如下：\n\n### 1. 事实支持（确认为 ImagePullBackOff）\n*   **Kubernetes 状态**：Pod 仍处于 `Pending` 阶段，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，原因为 `ImagePullBackOff`。\n*   **Prometheus 指标**：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 实时返回 `reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"`，值为 1，证实异常当前仍然存在。\n*   **Pod YAML**：未配置 `imagePullSecrets`，镜像标签为 `Always` 拉取策略。\n\n### 2. 根因定位（镜像 Tag 不存在）\n*   **Events 原始错误**：kubelet 报错 `Failed to pull image... : rpc error: code = NotFound ... failed to resolve reference", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789442719712, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

